## About this Devlog

This devlog contains reports about progress in the project. It does not cover
everything that has happened, but it's a heartbeat that shows how the project
progresses over time.

This page lists entries for the first quarter of 2025, for past and future entries consult the [devlog archive](/devlog/).

## Entries

> []($block.attrs('note'))
> All of these posts were pulled from the [Discord](/community) server and were converted into the
> devlog in March 2026.

